{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Animation｜流程图\n一帧只读语义如何进入 AnimBP；类关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_动画与表现.canvas|结构图]]、[[Animation/结构|结构文档]]。动画曲线另见 [[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|子图]]。\n普攻目标：[[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段]]。\n普攻资产：[[Animation/普攻动画实施|契约、调查与验收]]（资产已保存/待接线验收）。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1740,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. CMC / ASC / Pawn 在各自引擎生命周期更新权威状态。\n\n来源接口：CMC::GetResolvedGait/HasMoveInput/IsTurnBackCurveDriven，ASC::HasMatchingGameplayTag，Pawn Transform。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. AnimInstanceBase 在 NativeUpdateAnimation 捕获一帧 AnimationStateFrame。\n\n调用：AnimInstanceBase::NativeUpdateAnimation → StateCapture::Capture(OutState, OutDebug, Pawn)；游戏线程一次集中抓取。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ABP_Pyrios 读取输入、步态、转身等语义事实。\n\nAnimBP 经 AnimInstanceBase::GetAnimationStateFrame 和 HasAnimationStateTag/IsAnimationRunGait 等只读查询获得事实。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "transition",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. AnimBP 过渡图选择 EnterMove、Moving、Stop、TurnBack 等状态。\n\nAnimBP 过渡规则消费 StateFrame；C++ 不返回具体 ABP 状态名，EnterMove/Stop/TurnBack 选择留在蓝图。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "play",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 状态图选动画序列 / BlendSpace。\n\nGetSeqByKey：EnterMove / Stop / TurnBack 单次播放，Idle 循环。\nGetBlendSpaceByKey(WalkRun)：GaitBlendY → X 轴 WalkRunBlendAlpha（0 Walk / 1 Run）。\n单次段不循环，末尾条件才能稳定退出。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 932,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "compat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "兼容路径：ZZZ 适配旧 Snapshot，仍推进 StopValue 与 GaitBlendY。\n\n调用：ZZZAnimInstance::NativeUpdateAnimation → LegacySnapshotAdapter::Capture(StateFrame, DebugFrame) → 旧状态记忆。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "future",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "目标：表现记忆回到 AnimBP，MotionProfile/Linked Layer 继续按计划迁移。\n[[计划_动画与表现层]]",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_entry",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 普攻播放入口（待集成）\nGA 通过 Montage Task 播放本段 Main。\n三份 Montage 已保存并静态回读；ABP Slot 尚未接入。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|实际资产与验收范围]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|GA 规则]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage 时间轴（已配置）\n独立 HitWindow / ComboWindow 发 Event.Montage Begin/End。\nGA 校验播放来源并消费请求；运行时待验收。\n01 Combo 结束于115帧，早于116帧 BlendOut；60 fps。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 未换段 → End（资产已配置）\nMain.NextSectionName=End，End.NextSectionName=None。\nEnd 取素材前30/45/90帧；Combo跨入End 14/18/18帧。\n默认 BlendOut 从116/111/159帧开始，持续15帧（60 fps）。",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_return",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FullBody BlendOut → 移动（待实测）\nSlot 混回持续更新的 locomotion 源姿势。\n检查 End→Idle/Walk/Run 与中断回移动。\n当前无 Slot；Bip001 修正和 CMC 曲线消费须先验证。",
      "x": 1530,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
